@0    = ~...no, that's what I'm saying! I refuse to be some nobody when I die.~
@1    = ~Hey, you're not a nobody. You've got your Archmage de'Arnise, haven't you?~
@2    = ~Hey, you're not a nobody. You've got your connection to <CHARNAME>, haven't you?~
@3    = ~That's not the point.~
@4    = ~Isn't it?~
@5    = ~I want to be remembered in my own right, for the things I do - not just for the things I do with other people. Don't you get that?~
@6    = ~Yeah. Yeah, I do get what you mean. But no point thinking too far ahead - we've got enough on our plates right now, haven't we?~
